From: TripleU <182648541+TripleU613@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:48:04 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] J714s release 11: kernel v272-21 and Mesa e705eca833f (M5 Pro
 GPU)

Re-pinned from betizzel/omarchy-m5:
- linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora17.v272-21 (2026eef5..., 44765819 bytes) from
  d3b70d2: aurora-silicon/linux main 7f00dc6bc52c plus
  patches/j714s-27.2/linux 0001-0011. Booted and tested on the J714s
  2026-11-26. The qualification pins follow 7.3.0-17.v272-21-ARCH.
- mesa-aurora and vulkan-aurora 1:26.3.0_devel.20261122.232644.e705eca833f-1
  (a62773a5..., 4c231780...), omacom/omarchy-pkgs 9e1c6ef1 as published in
  Omarchy edge. The j714s2 build (043a4c5) does not implement the G17S
  HAL300 command stream, so the desktop fell back to llvmpipe; this build
  runs OpenGL 4.6 and Vulkan 1.4 on the M5 Pro (glmark2 3003 against 89,
  27 validated scenes, vkcube) on our J714s.
Nothing else changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
